+    test_pc5ctl_usb_descriptor_identity.UsbIdentityBoundaryTests.test_02_descriptor_closed_before_the_child_launches
+
+### m9-open-failure-writes-by-name
+Turn the target-open refusal into a fallback: when `os.open` fails, dd is launched against the device *pathname*. The fail-open shape the descriptor binding exists to remove, and the `nothing was written` contract is lost.
+tests run: 91; exit code: 1; assertion failures overall: 1
