+### m7-unreadable-topology-is-empty
+Treat unreadable topology as an empty relationship set: a `slaves` or `holders` directory that cannot be listed becomes 'no relationships'.
+tests run: 87; exit code: 1; assertion failures detected: 1
+  intended test did not fail: test_13_unreadable_sysfs_relationship_data
