+  intended test FAIL: test_unreadable_slaves_is_unknown_not_empty
+    test_pc5ctl_usb_safety.UnknownTopologyRefuses.test_unreadable_slaves_is_unknown_not_empty
+  intended test did not fail: test_unreadable_slaves_refuses_the_physical_backing_partition
+
+### m8-open-failure-writes-by-name
+Turn the target-open refusal into a fallback: when ``os.open`` fails, dd is launched against the device *pathname* instead of the command refusing. This is the fail-open shape the descriptor work exists to remove, and it also drops the ``nothing was written`` contract.
